From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 07:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: Add the Exynos9820 mailbox and ACPM firmware

The mailbox and the firmware that answers on it are the only way to the
main power management chip of this SoC, and both drivers in this series
already speak to them.  Describe the two compatibles they bind to.

The hardware is the one gs101 already has, only with different register
offsets, which is what the compatible tells the driver apart by.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/firmware/google,gs101-acpm-ipc.yaml   | 4 +++-
 .../devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml        | 4 +++-
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/firmware/google,gs101-acpm-ipc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/firmware/google,gs101-acpm-ipc.yaml
index e68f9c3ca5e..c0854b3cd69 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/firmware/google,gs101-acpm-ipc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/firmware/google,gs101-acpm-ipc.yaml
@@ -22,7 +22,9 @@ description: |
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: google,gs101-acpm-ipc
+    enum:
+      - google,gs101-acpm-ipc
+      - samsung,exynos9820-acpm-ipc
 
   "#clock-cells":
     const: 1
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
index e249db4c1fb..fb46be543f1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
@@ -20,7 +20,9 @@ description:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: google,gs101-mbox
+    enum:
+      - google,gs101-mbox
+      - samsung,exynos9820-mbox
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
